\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 Final Ollama Prompt\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Use a prompt similar to:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
You are evaluating a potential software opportunity.\
\
You have researched an existing product, its users,\
complaints, competitors, alternatives, and apparent\
market conditions.\
\
Your job is to determine whether creating a competing\
or improved product appears worth seriously considering.\
\
Do not assume that:\
\
- A poorly rated app is a good opportunity.\
- A popular app can easily be competed with.\
- High install counts automatically indicate willingness to pay.\
- User complaints are automatically solvable.\
- A lack of competitors automatically indicates demand.\
\
Consider:\
\
- Evidence of demand\
